#X text 10 10 OLED via O2O (127.0.0.1:7562) \, one line: juno~'s display title and value - a turned control (VCF freq 64) \, the patch that plays (Preset 12 Brass) \, Stored User 11. At most every 50 ms. The same goes to the Launchkey's display (lkdisplay \, main patch)., f 100;
